  B-B  TASK 4: negative vacuum + Tolman radiation
  ok    B-B1 rho + p > 0 for every combination scanned   9 combinations, 0 non-positive
  ok    B-B2 so Hdot < 0 always -> NO BOUNCE from these two   rho+p = (4/3) rho_r, the vacuum drops out entirely

